{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_1_014_02_g",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:e8e94daa4dfb18642f4f6b686f43887aaee720d8beff08f3b58c617f3ce2b52f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_g:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:72aea5431e00b111db2eda58e12c9ce02f1b3b48d66046d466e2885ee35a633d",
      "text": "话说回来，救下的人竟然是\n那个顶尖偶像秋月凉啊～",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_g:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7a2f7e22a3ea289e111dc886dd3bd5cd652a21fd2bbe25384792a09e6de5c94c",
      "text": "发现的时候吓了一跳呢！\n世上真有这种巧合啊，哇哈哈。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_g:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:88280192a82cc94aef69e15b8c05974e3ab81dafcf917360a366baf985e23653",
      "text": "那个，现在与其说是顶尖偶像，不如说是正要去\n重新向顶尖偶像发起挑战……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_g:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:243485cd23f0a0a5159d82ab915f93218653a2303296fc9d23988a2238bd0912",
      "text": "这次是“作为男性偶像”，吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_g:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bd4fb41ab48979bfdd6a69f5f0917d402f00e135ba35eea1fccd92ec9f862746",
      "text": "嗯。你知道这个的话，\n是看了电视吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_g:cmd-000056:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b96db74723524a26c18a5743e96f45d38aa1975144dfa1b637b6e4592caab12e",
      "text": "嗯。那时候的你，超级帅气啊！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_g:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:ddce5ba2728da0181df199d9a1952a5b32152a38256d67e188f7e0859baefcb0",
      "text": "能在那么多人面前，讲述自己的决意，\n真是个有胆量的家伙！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_1_014fla_02_1_1_014_02:1_1_014_02_g:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0a2522d7a31072b941f06e4ef7566445c85f79915c82535158341534ded5bd30",
      "text": "诶嘿嘿……谢谢你。\n能被你这么说我好开心。",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
